{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"append","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"newElement","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s15ContiguousArrayV7Elementxmfp"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"newElement","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The element to append to the array.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this method to append a single element to the end of a mutable array."}]},{"code":["var numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]","numbers.append(100)","print(numbers)","\/\/ Prints \"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 100]\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because arrays increase their allocated capacity using an exponential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strategy, appending a single element to an array is an O(1) operation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when averaged over many calls to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"append(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method. When an array"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has additional capacity and is not sharing its storage with another"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance, appending an element is O(1). When an array needs to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reallocate storage before appending or its storage is shared with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another copy, appending is O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), where "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the length of the array."}]},{"name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1) on average, over many calls to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"append(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"same array.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds a new element at the end of the array."}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"2.0","deprecated":false}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"append(_:)","externalID":"s:s15ContiguousArrayV6appendyyxnF","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"append","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s15ContiguousArrayV7Elementxmfp","text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ContiguousArray\/append(_:)"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation